{"slug": "yu1CSHJZj6xLmqym-QF5pA", "title": "MCP 协议：Agent 的统一工具接口", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-10-01", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yu1CSHJZj6xLmqym-QF5pA", "digest": "MCP 协议：Agent 的统一工具接口", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位：Agent 原理系列板块二·机制第 05 篇——MCP 协议（Model Context Protocol）：Agent 的「HTTP」。三原语、客户端-服务端架构、标准化之路（Anthropic 开源 → Linux Foundation 托管 → 2026-07-28 无状态规范 RC），以及它与 A2A 的分工。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "免责声明：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方协议规范为准。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 05 篇 · MCP 协议：Agent 的统一工具接口"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "导读"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 04 篇说行动靠工具，但有个历史痛点：每家框架自己接工具（LangChain 一套、AutoGPT 一套、自研又一套）——给数据库写一次集成，每个框架都得重写。MCP（Model Context Protocol）像浏览器有 HTTP、IDE 有 LSP 一样，给「Agent ↔ 工具」一个统一协议：工具接一次，处处可用。本篇是 Agent 机制层的基石。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、MCP 是什么"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.1 一句话"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MCP 是「Agent 客户端」与「工具/数据服务端」之间的标准化连接协议（JSON-RPC 2.0）——把「模型怎么调用工具」统一成工业协议。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.2 定位类比"}, {"type": "p", "text": "场景"}, {"type": "p", "text": "协议"}, {"type": "p", "text": "浏览器 ↔ 网站"}, {"type": "p", "text": "HTTP"}, {"type": "p", "text": "IDE ↔ 语言能力"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LSP"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent ↔ 工具/数据MCP"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•2024-11 Anthropic 开源；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•2025-04 ChatGPT 接入（转折点：不再是 Anthropic 专属）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•2025-12 捐赠 Linux Foundation 旗下 Agentic AI Foundation（AAIF，与 OpenAI/Google/Microsoft/AWS 共管）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•2026-03：SDK 月下载 97M、公共服务器 9400+——业界默认工具协议。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、架构与三原语"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2.1 客户端-服务端模型"}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent / 框架（MCP 客户端）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "│ 发现工具 → 调用工具 → 回传结果"}, {"type": "p", "text": "▼"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MCP 服务端（封装数据库/API/文件/业务系统）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•传输：stdio（本地子进程，开发用）/ Streamable HTTP（远程生产用）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•2026-07-28 规范 RC：核心无状态化——普通 HTTP 负载均衡即可横向扩展（去掉会话黏滞）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2.2 三原语（一个服务端暴露三类能力）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "原语"}, {"type": "p", "text": "作用"}, {"type": "p", "text": "例子"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Tools"}, {"type": "p", "text": "可执行动作"}, {"type": "p", "text": "github.create_issue"}, {"type": "p", "text": "、db.query"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Resources"}, {"type": "p", "text": "可读数据（只读上下文）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数据库 Schema、文件内容、API 文档"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Prompts"}, {"type": "p", "text": "可复用提示模板"}, {"type": "p", "text": "代码审查模板、Bug 报告模板"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•设计要点：工具粒度映射「自然意图」（建 issue/查库存）而非低层 API——粒度决定调用质量（衔接 04 篇）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "05SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、2026-07-28 规范 RC 的四个升级（最新）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1无状态核心：协议层去会话——Mcp-Method 头路由、tools/list 可缓存，水平扩展如普通服务；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2Tasks 扩展：长时运行工作（异步长任务）成为一等公民；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3MCP Apps：服务端渲染 UI——工具不只返回数据，还能返回界面；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4授权对齐 OAuth/OpenID：企业级鉴权；另有正式弃用策略（协议可持续演进）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•影响：远程 MCP 服务不再需要 sticky session/共享会话存储——部署成本与 HTTP 同级。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、MCP 与 A2A 的分工（两张协议地图）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "协议"}, {"type": "p", "text": "连接"}, {"type": "p", "text": "场景"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MCP"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent ↔ 工具/数据"}, {"type": "p", "text": "让 Agent 能用一切（工具接入）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "A2A"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（Google 2025-04，入 AAIF）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent ↔ Agent"}, {"type": "p", "text": "让 Agent 能互相协作（任务委派）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•MCP = 毛细血管（接工具），A2A = 大动脉（接同事）——2026 后两协议同一基金会治理，构成完整互操作层。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "07SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "五、工程实践要点"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1BFMCP 模式（Backend for MCP）：MCP 服务端只暴露业务级操作，后端承接数据访问与权限控制——避免把「裸 SQL 查询」直接交给 Agent（权限最小化，衔接 04 篇安全）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2三原语并用：好的服务端不只 Tools，还用 Resources（给上下文）+ Prompts（标准化交互）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3一个服务端多处用：写一次 MCP server，Claude/ChatGPT/Gemini/Cursor 全部可用——集成成本从 18 小时降到约 4 小时（2026 行业数据）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "08SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "六、本篇要点（复习卡片）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1MCP = Agent 的 HTTP：统一「Agent ↔ 工具」连接协议；2024-11 开源 → 2026 已成行业标准（AAIF 托管、97M 月下载）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2三原语：Tools（动作）/ Resources（数据）/ Prompts（模板）——好服务端三者并用。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3两传输：stdio（本地）/ Streamable HTTP（远程）；2026-07-28 RC 核心无状态化。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4四个升级：无状态 / Tasks 长任务 / MCP Apps 服务端 UI / OAuth 授权对齐。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5分工：MCP 管「接工具」，A2A 管「接 Agent」——同一基金会治理。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "6实践：BFMCP 防裸权限；写一次到处用。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "09SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "七、下一篇预告"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 06 篇（板块二·机制）：多 Agent 协作与编排——一个 Agent 不够时怎么办：图编排（LangGraph，显式状态图）/ 角色制（CrewAI，团队分工）/ 交接制（OpenAI Agents SDK，子 Agent 委派）三范式对比，以及多 Agent 的通信与任务分发。MCP 给了工具，编排给了「组织」。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "10SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "参考资料"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] MCP 规范：https://modelcontextprotocol.io"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] MCP 2026-07-28 规范 RC 公告：https://blog.modelcontextprotocol.io/posts/2026-07-28-release-candidate/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] MCP 捐赠 Linux Foundation（2025-12）：https://www.linuxfoundation.org/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[参考] MCP 采用数据（97M 下载/9400+ 服务器）：行业统计报道"}, {"type": "p", "text": "整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方协议规范。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：Agent 原理系列板块二·机制第 05 篇——MCP 协议（Model Context Protocol）：Agent 的「HTTP」。三原语、客户端-服务端架构、标准化之路（Anthropic 开源 → Linux Foundation 托管 → 2026-07-28 无状态规范 RC），以及它与 A2A 的分工。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>免责声明</span></strong><span>：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方协议规范为准。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>第 05 篇 · MCP 协议：Agent 的统一工具接口</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>导读</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 04 篇说行动靠工具，但有个历史痛点：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>每家框架自己接工具</span></strong><span>（LangChain 一套、AutoGPT 一套、自研又一套）——给数据库写一次集成，每个框架都得重写。MCP（Model Context Protocol）像浏览器有 HTTP、IDE 有 LSP 一样，</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>给「Agent ↔ 工具」一个统一协议</span></strong><span>：工具接一次，处处可用。本篇是 Agent 机制层的基石。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、MCP 是什么</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.1 一句话</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP 是「Agent 客户端」与「工具/数据服务端」之间的标准化连接协议</span></strong><span>（JSON-RPC 2.0）——把「模型怎么调用工具」统一成工业协议。</span></p></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.2 定位类比</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>场景</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>协议</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>浏览器 ↔ 网站</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>HTTP</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>IDE ↔ 语言能力</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LSP</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent ↔ 工具/数据</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP</span></strong></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2024-11 Anthropic 开源；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2025-04 ChatGPT 接入（转折点：不再是 Anthropic 专属）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2025-12 捐赠 Linux Foundation 旗下 Agentic AI Foundation（AAIF，与 OpenAI/Google/Microsoft/AWS 共管）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2026-03：SDK 月下载&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>97M</span></strong><span>、公共服务器&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>9400+</span></strong><span>——业界默认工具协议。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、架构与三原语</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.1 客户端-服务端模型</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>Agent / 框架（MCP 客户端）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; │ 发现工具 → 调用工具 → 回传结果</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; ▼</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>MCP 服务端（封装数据库/API/文件/业务系统）</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>传输：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>stdio</span></strong><span>（本地子进程，开发用）/&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Streamable HTTP</span></strong><span>（远程生产用）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2026-07-28 规范 RC：核心</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>无状态化</span></strong><span>——普通 HTTP 负载均衡即可横向扩展（去掉会话黏滞）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.2 三原语（一个服务端暴露三类能力）</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>原语</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>作用</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>例子</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Tools</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>可执行动作</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>github.create_issue</span></span><section><span>、</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>db.query</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Resources</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>可读数据（只读上下文）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>数据库 Schema、文件内容、API 文档</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Prompts</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>可复用提示模板</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>代码审查模板、Bug 报告模板</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>设计要点：工具粒度映射「自然意图」（建 issue/查库存）而非低层 API——粒度决定调用质量（衔接 04 篇）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、2026-07-28 规范 RC 的四个升级（最新）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>无状态核心</span></strong><span>：协议层去会话——</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>Mcp-Method</span></span><span>&nbsp;头路由、</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>tools/list</span></span><span>&nbsp;可缓存，水平扩展如普通服务；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Tasks 扩展</span></strong><span>：长时运行工作（异步长任务）成为一等公民；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP Apps</span></strong><span>：服务端渲染 UI——工具不只返回数据，还能返回界面；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>授权对齐 OAuth/OpenID</span></strong><span>：企业级鉴权；另有正式弃用策略（协议可持续演进）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>影响：远程 MCP 服务不再需要 sticky session/共享会话存储——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>部署成本与 HTTP 同级</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、MCP 与 A2A 的分工（两张协议地图）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>协议</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>连接</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>场景</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Agent ↔ 工具/数据</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>让 Agent 能用一切（工具接入）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>A2A</span></strong><section><span>（Google 2025-04，入 AAIF）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Agent ↔ Agent</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>让 Agent 能互相协作（任务委派）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>MCP = 毛细血管（接工具），A2A = 大动脉（接同事）——2026 后两协议同一基金会治理，构成完整互操作层。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、工程实践要点</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>BFMCP 模式</span></strong><span>（Backend for MCP）：MCP 服务端只暴露</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>业务级操作</span></strong><span>，后端承接数据访问与权限控制——避免把「裸 SQL 查询」直接交给 Agent（权限最小化，衔接 04 篇安全）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>三原语并用</span></strong><span>：好的服务端不只 Tools，还用 Resources（给上下文）+ Prompts（标准化交互）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>一个服务端多处用</span></strong><span>：写一次 MCP server，Claude/ChatGPT/Gemini/Cursor 全部可用——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>集成成本从 18 小时降到约 4 小时</span></strong><span>（2026 行业数据）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>六、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP = Agent 的 HTTP</span></strong><span>：统一「Agent ↔ 工具」连接协议；2024-11 开源 → 2026 已成行业标准（AAIF 托管、97M 月下载）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>三原语</span></strong><span>：Tools（动作）/ Resources（数据）/ Prompts（模板）——好服务端三者并用。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>两传输</span></strong><span>：stdio（本地）/ Streamable HTTP（远程）；2026-07-28 RC 核心无状态化。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>四个升级</span></strong><span>：无状态 / Tasks 长任务 / MCP Apps 服务端 UI / OAuth 授权对齐。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>分工</span></strong><span>：MCP 管「接工具」，A2A 管「接 Agent」——同一基金会治理。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>6</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>实践</span></strong><span>：BFMCP 防裸权限；写一次到处用。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>09</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>七、下一篇预告</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 06 篇（板块二·机制）：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>多 Agent 协作与编排</span></strong><span>——一个 Agent 不够时怎么办：图编排（LangGraph，显式状态图）/ 角色制（CrewAI，团队分工）/ 交接制（OpenAI Agents SDK，子 Agent 委派）三范式对比，以及多 Agent 的通信与任务分发。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP 给了工具，编排给了「组织」。</span></strong></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>10</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] MCP 规范：</span><span>https://modelcontextprotocol.io</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] MCP 2026-07-28 规范 RC 公告：</span><span>https://blog.modelcontextprotocol.io/posts/2026-07-28-release-candidate/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] MCP 捐赠 Linux Foundation（2025-12）：</span><span>https://www.linuxfoundation.org/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[参考] MCP 采用数据（97M 下载/9400+ 服务器）：行业统计报道</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方协议规范。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:32:54+0800"}